Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:36.25,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Kernel-grade code reviews
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:36.25,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}won partners like ARM and
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:00:36.25,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}Microsoft”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,At the time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.88,0:00:02.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,also, before the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:04.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,AI takeover
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:05.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,the software that we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:05.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,were building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.92,0:00:07.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,we were being very
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.32,0:00:08.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,precise and Linux
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:09.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,kernel-like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the sense that lots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:10.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,of reviews
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.80,0:00:12.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,there were typically
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.16,0:00:13.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,four, six eyes looking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:14.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,at every single commit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:15.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,before it was being
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.66,0:00:18.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,done. It was really like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.40,0:00:19.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,trying to be the best
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.44,0:00:20.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,line of code every time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.40,0:00:21.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,and people were looking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.04,0:00:21.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,up to that and trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.90,0:00:22.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,that out and making sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:23.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,that they really
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:24.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,understood it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:25.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,From that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:26.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,we kind of got industry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:27.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,partners
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.40,0:00:27.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,so we ended up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.92,0:00:29.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,partnering with ARM
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,and recently Microsoft
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:32.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,to kind of look at this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:34.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,as a piece of stable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:34.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,understood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,thought-out software.
